<body>
    <h1>New a git repo from an existing repo</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrappe=
r"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" loading=3D"lazy" s=
rc=3D"999675cffb6abb2c5fb4ddda65af8422137b7870d145a629c66b97ecc91c929f" dat=
a-image-src=3D"https://hongkongtv.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3=
617030200/Screenshot%202023-07-04%20at%202.25.58%20PM.png?version=3D1&amp;m=
odificationDate=3D1688451966082&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-hei=
ght=3D"149" data-width=3D"1100" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-li=
nked-resource-id=3D"3617030207" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-lin=
ked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Scre=
enshot 2023-07-04 at 2.25.58 PM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://hongkongtv.at=
lassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-link=
ed-resource-container-id=3D"3617030200" data-linked-resource-container-vers=
ion=3D"1" data-media-id=3D"3f8502c7-71b2-445d-b3b2-425705658a46" data-media=
-type=3D"file" width=3D"468" height=3D"63"></span>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>create from brand new</p></li>
<li>
<p>create from existing, which GitLab export</p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<p>for GitLab export, tried goto existing report: hktvmms; setting, goto ex=
port; it will generate a .tar file</p>
<p>goto new project, import page, upload the .tar file; but said the size t=
oo large, cannot upload;</p>
<p>Need Admin to set the upload size, to allow large file; default seem 50m=
b; hktvmms is around 800mb;</p>
<p></p>
<p>So chose, create from brand new;</p>
<p></p>
<p>After created the project; then goto old project; run below command to p=
ush existing branched and code to new project;</p>
<p></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">// chan=
ge origin to new repo
git remote rename origin old-origin
git remote add origin https://ite-git01.hktv.com.hk/hktv/tw/app/hktv3pl

// push local branches and tag to origin; requires email and 2fa token as p=
assword
git push --set-upstream origin --all
git push --set-upstream origin --tags</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<p>after run these command, ur local branches will be push to new repo afte=
wards;</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
